---
flowchart LR
    O1["Evaluate parents and children with<br/>one operator attributed per child"]:::csMuted
    O2["Rank candidate fitness; compute<br/>parent-to-child improvement"]:::csInfo
    O3["Credit only established operators<br/>with sufficient independent trials"]:::csAccent
    O4["Breed mutation instructions and<br/>realize attributable children"]:::csSpecial
    O5["Seal the next generation;<br/>holdout remains candidate-only"]:::csSuccess
    O1 --> O2 --> O3 --> O4 --> O5
    O4 -.->|next sealed generation| O1
  classDef csAccent fill:#cdf3ff,stroke:#007298,color:#333e48,stroke-width:2px;
  classDef csMuted fill:#e7e7e7,stroke:#828282,color:#333e48,stroke-width:2px;
  classDef csSuccess fill:#dbffcc,stroke:#45842a,color:#333e48,stroke-width:2px;
  classDef csInfo fill:#cdf3ff,stroke:#00ace6,color:#333e48,stroke-width:2px;
  classDef csSpecial fill:#f9ccff,stroke:#652f6c,color:#333e48,stroke-width:2px;
